{
 "site": "https://fox-research-il.web.app",
 "terms": "Free to use, including commercially. Cite fox (with a link to the page or file) and the primary source the record names: the MAYA filing and page, or the regulator's dataset. Fundamentals only: no share prices are published (the valuation pages take a manual price input). The files are static and refreshed by the pipeline; there is no key and no rate limit, but please cache: every file is served with a short max-age. No warranty: check the figure against the cited page before relying on it.",
 "feeds": [
  [
   "/feed.xml",
   "RSS 2.0",
   "the delta feed: every new filing figure, restatement, target, regulator month (feed.json as RSS)"
  ],
  [
   "/feed.atom",
   "Atom",
   "the same feed as Atom"
  ],
  [
   "/feed/<company>.xml",
   "RSS 2.0",
   "one company's events (also .atom)"
  ],
  [
   "/feed/months.xml",
   "RSS 2.0",
   "the regulator's monthly files as they land (also .atom)"
  ],
  [
   "/feed/funds.xml",
   "RSS 2.0",
   "fund and track events (also .atom)"
  ],
  [
   "/feed/market.xml",
   "RSS 2.0",
   "market-level events (also .atom)"
  ],
  [
   "/data/calendar.ics",
   "iCalendar",
   "every expected filing date (calendar.json as ICS)"
  ],
  [
   "/data/cal/<company>.ics",
   "iCalendar",
   "one company's expected filing dates"
  ],
  [
   "/data/xlsx/<company>.xlsx",
   "XLSX",
   "the model-ready workbook of a company: metrics x periods Q1'23 ... Q2'26 + FY, every value with its document, page and link (Sources sheet)"
  ],
  [
   "/data/tables/v1/<table>.csv",
   "CSV",
   "fox inside Excel: a long table (UTF-8 with BOM), one row per figure with its source; also .json except savings_m and funds_m; CORS open"
  ],
  [
   "/data/tables/v1/manifest.json",
   "JSON",
   "the tables: row counts, sha256, first and last period, last-changed date, metric dictionary"
  ],
  [
   "/data/tables/v1/changes.json",
   "JSON",
   "what changed since the previous build: rows added / changed / removed per table, a dated log (also changes.csv)"
  ],
  [
   "/data/tables/v1/fox_powerquery.xlsx",
   "XLSX",
   "the Power Query kit: one query per table at the stable URLs; Data > Refresh All (M scripts: /data/tables/v1/pq/<table>.pq)"
  ],
  [
   "/data/schemas.json",
   "JSON Schema",
   "the data contracts: the schema of every contracted family below"
  ]
 ],
 "changelog": [
  [
   "2026-11-05",
   "added",
   "tables/v1/: fox inside Excel. Seven long tables (kpi, ifrs17, solvency, pnc, savings_q, savings_m, funds_m) as CSV (+ JSON, except savings_m and funds_m) with a source on every row, manifest.json, changes.json, Power Query scripts and fox_powerquery.xlsx (schemas `tablesTable`, `tablesManifest`, `tablesChanges`); CORS open on /data/tables/**."
  ],
  [
   "2026-11-05",
   "added",
   "corrections.json: the corrections log of /about#corrections, one entry per corrected figure (schema `corrections`); starts empty."
  ],
  [
   "2026-11-02",
   "added",
   "xlsx/<company>.xlsx: one model-ready workbook per company (P&L, Balance sheet, IFRS 17, Solvency, Savings, KPIs, Sources)."
  ],
  [
   "2026-11-02",
   "added",
   "consensus.json: published sell-side price targets and recommendations, each with its source URL (schema `consensus`)."
  ],
  [
   "2026-11-02",
   "added",
   "This page and docs/API.md. No changelog was kept before this date: the contracts in schemas.json as of this date are the baseline."
  ]
 ],
